# nvh review demo — record with: vhs docs/recordings/review-demo.tape

Output docs/screenshots/review-demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20

Type "# nvHive Code Review — multi-model cross-verification"
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Review staged changes
Type "nvh review --mode multi"
Enter
Sleep 20s
